      "chunk_index": 1,
      "chars": 486,
      "preview": "其中$m$为预测电压裕度，$\\delta_w = 0.006$ p.u.为惩罚窗口宽度。$\\delta_{\\text{safe}}$和$\\delta_w$的取值"
